[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 127.",
    "start": 1.55,
    "end": 5.022,
    "zh": "第127课。",
    "zh_hant": "第127課。"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "A famous actress.",
    "start": 5.072,
    "end": 6.833,
    "zh": "一位著名的女演员。",
    "zh_hant": "一位著名的女演員。"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "Listen to the tape then answer this question.",
    "start": 8.334,
    "end": 11.675,
    "zh": "听录音，然后回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "聽錄音，然後回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "Who is only twenty-nine,",
    "start": 13.756,
    "end": 16.077,
    "zh": "谁只有二十九岁，",
    "zh_hant": "誰只有二十九歲，"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "and why is it so unclear?",
    "start": 16.177,
    "end": 18.758,
    "zh": "为什么这件事如此不清楚？",
    "zh_hant": "為什麼這件事如此不清楚？"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "Can you recognize that woman, Liz?",
    "start": 21.08,
    "end": 23.921,
    "zh": "你能认出那个女人吗，莉兹？",
    "zh_hant": "你能認出那個女人嗎，莉茲？"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "I think I can, Kate.",
    "start": 25.242,
    "end": 27.163,
    "zh": "我想我能，凯特。",
    "zh_hant": "我想我能，凱特。"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "It must be Karen Marsh, the actress.",
    "start": 27.163,
    "end": 30.304,
    "zh": "那一定是女演员卡伦·马什。",
    "zh_hant": "那一定是女演員卡倫·馬什。"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "I thought so.",
    "start": 31.405,
    "end": 32.685,
    "zh": "我也是这么想的。",
    "zh_hant": "我也是這麼想的。"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "Who's that beside her?",
    "start": 33.166,
    "end": 34.966,
    "zh": "她旁边那个人是谁？",
    "zh_hant": "她旁邊那個人是誰？"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "That must be Conrad Reeves.",
    "start": 36.407,
    "end": 39.449,
    "zh": "那一定是康拉德·里夫斯。",
    "zh_hant": "那一定是康拉德·裡夫斯。"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "Conrad Reeves, the actor?",
    "start": 40.289,
    "end": 42.551,
    "zh": "康拉德·里夫斯，那个演员？",
    "zh_hant": "康拉德·裡夫斯，那個演員？"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "It can't be.",
    "start": 42.871,
    "end": 44.451,
    "zh": "不可能。",
    "zh_hant": "不可能。"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "Let me have another look.",
    "start": 44.752,
    "end": 46.232,
    "zh": "让我再看一眼。",
    "zh_hant": "讓我再看一眼。"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "I think you're right!",
    "start": 47.393,
    "end": 48.954,
    "zh": "我想你是对的！",
    "zh_hant": "我想你是對的！"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "Isn't he her third husband?",
    "start": 49.754,
    "end": 52.275,
    "zh": "他不是她的第三任丈夫吗？",
    "zh_hant": "他不是她的第三任丈夫嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "No.",
    "start": 53.316,
    "end": 53.936,
    "zh": "不是。",
    "zh_hant": "不是。"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "He must be her fourth or fifth.",
    "start": 54.136,
    "end": 56.898,
    "zh": "他一定是她的第四任或第五任。",
    "zh_hant": "他一定是她的第四任或第五任。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "Doesn't Karen Marsh look old!",
    "start": 57.838,
    "end": 60.719,
    "zh": "卡伦·马什看起来多老啊！",
    "zh_hant": "卡倫·馬什看起來多老啊！"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "She does, doesn't she!",
    "start": 61.6,
    "end": 63.361,
    "zh": "是的，确实很老！",
    "zh_hant": "是的，確實很老！"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "I read she's twenty-nine,",
    "start": 64.241,
    "end": 66.682,
    "zh": "我读到说她二十九岁，",
    "zh_hant": "我讀到說她二十九歲，"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "but she must be at least forty.",
    "start": 66.823,
    "end": 69.924,
    "zh": "但她一定至少四十岁了。",
    "zh_hant": "但她一定至少四十歲了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "I'm sure she is.",
    "start": 71.145,
    "end": 72.965,
    "zh": "我确信她是。",
    "zh_hant": "我確信她是。"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "She was a famous actress when I was still at school.",
    "start": 74.066,
    "end": 78.368,
    "zh": "我还在上学的时候，她就是著名女演员了。",
    "zh_hant": "我還在上學的時候，她就是著名女演員了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "That was a long time ago, wasn't it?",
    "start": 79.629,
    "end": 82.192,
    "zh": "那是很久以前的事了，不是吗？",
    "zh_hant": "那是很久以前的事了，不是嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "text": "Not that long ago!",
    "start": 82.996,
    "end": 84.68,
    "zh": "没那么久！",
    "zh_hant": "沒那麼久！"
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "text": "I'm not more than twenty-nine myself.",
    "start": 85.263,
    "end": 88.05,
    "zh": "我自己还不到二十九岁。",
    "zh_hant": "我自己還不到二十九歲。"
  }
]
